            {
              "id": "cc7.5/key-rotation",
              "name": "KeyRotation",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A secret and key rotation procedure is documented"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A procedure says which secrets and keys are rotated, how, on what schedule, and on exposure or personnel change."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Document each secret, where it lives, how to rotate it, and when (≤ 90 days, or on exposure or departure).\n\nRisk: Unrotated credentials stay valid long after they leak or their holder leaves.",
                "markdown": "**CC7.5**: A procedure says which secrets and keys are rotated, how, on what schedule, and on exposure or personnel change.\n\n**Risk:** Unrotated credentials stay valid long after they leak or their holder leaves.\n\n**Fix:** Document each secret, where it lives, how to rotate it, and when (≤ 90 days, or on exposure or departure).\n\nExample:\n\n```\n## Rotating secrets\n| Secret | Where | How | When |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Database password | AWS Secrets Manager | Automatic rotation Lambda | Every 30 days |\n```"
              },
