            {
              "id": "cc8.1/ci-on-pull-requests",
              "name": "CiOnPullRequests",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CI runs tests and lint on every pull request"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A CI pipeline runs automated tests and lint on every pull request, and branch protection requires it to pass before merge."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add a pull-request workflow that runs tests and lint, then make it a required status check.\n\nRisk: Without a test gate, broken or unreviewed behaviour reaches the default branch and production.",
                "markdown": "**CC8.1**: A CI pipeline runs automated tests and lint on every pull request, and branch protection requires it to pass before merge.\n\n**Risk:** Without a test gate, broken or unreviewed behaviour reaches the default branch and production.\n\n**Fix:** Add a pull-request workflow that runs tests and lint, then make it a required status check.\n\nExample:\n\n```\non: pull_request\npermissions: { contents: read }\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@<sha>\n      - run: npm ci && npm run lint && npm test\n```"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
