            {
              "id": "cc8.1/codeowners-sensitive-paths",
              "name": "CodeownersSensitivePaths",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Sensitive paths have named CODEOWNERS"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Security-sensitive paths (auth, IAM, crypto, payments, infrastructure, workflows, migrations, lockfiles) have a specific CODEOWNERS entry, not just the catch-all."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add explicit CODEOWNERS entries for sensitive paths and require code owner review. Adjust what counts as sensitive with sensitivePaths in threesock.yaml.\n\nRisk: Changes to the riskiest code can be approved by any reviewer instead of the people accountable for it.",
                "markdown": "**CC8.1**: Security-sensitive paths (auth, IAM, crypto, payments, infrastructure, workflows, migrations, lockfiles) have a specific CODEOWNERS entry, not just the catch-all.\n\n**Risk:** Changes to the riskiest code can be approved by any reviewer instead of the people accountable for it.\n\n**Fix:** Add explicit CODEOWNERS entries for sensitive paths and require code owner review. Adjust what counts as sensitive with sensitivePaths in threesock.yaml.\n\nExample:\n\n```\n/src/auth/            @your-org/security\n/infra/               @your-org/platform\n/.github/workflows/   @your-org/platform\n```"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
