              "help": {
                "text": "Keep a third-party inventory (service, purpose, data shared, owner) and generate an SBOM in CI.\n\nRisk: Unknown vendors and SDKs receive data nobody approved, and a vendor breach cannot be assessed quickly.",
                "markdown": "**CC9.2**: An inventory lists third-party services and integrations (with the data they receive), and an SBOM covers open-source dependencies.\n\n**Risk:** Unknown vendors and SDKs receive data nobody approved, and a vendor breach cannot be assessed quickly.\n\n**Fix:** Keep a third-party inventory (service, purpose, data shared, owner) and generate an SBOM in CI.\n\nExample:\n\n```\n| Service | Purpose | Data shared | Owner |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Stripe | Payments | Name, email, card token | @billing |\n```"
