            {
              "id": "pi1.1/api-contracts",
              "name": "ApiContracts",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "API contracts are published and versioned"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The API has a machine-readable contract (OpenAPI, GraphQL schema, protobuf) kept in the repository or generated from code."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Commit an OpenAPI document (or GraphQL schema / .proto files), or generate one from code, and version it.\n\nRisk: Without a contract, clients and the service disagree about inputs and outputs, and breaking changes go unnoticed.",
                "markdown": "**PI1.1**: The API has a machine-readable contract (OpenAPI, GraphQL schema, protobuf) kept in the repository or generated from code.\n\n**Risk:** Without a contract, clients and the service disagree about inputs and outputs, and breaking changes go unnoticed.\n\n**Fix:** Commit an OpenAPI document (or GraphQL schema / .proto files), or generate one from code, and version it.\n\nExample:\n\n```\nopenapi: 3.1.0\ninfo: { title: Orders API, version: 2.3.0 }\npaths: { /v2/orders: { get: { ... } } }\n```"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "soc2",
                  "PI1.1"
                ],
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "3.0",
                "criterion": "PI1.1"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "pi1.1/changelog",
              "name": "Changelog",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Changes are versioned and communicated in a changelog"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A changelog or release notes record each version, including breaking changes."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Keep a CHANGELOG.md (Keep a Changelog format) and call out breaking changes explicitly.\n\nRisk: Users and downstream systems are surprised by breaking changes, causing processing errors.",
                "markdown": "**PI1.1**: A changelog or release notes record each version, including breaking changes.\n\n**Risk:** Users and downstream systems are surprised by breaking changes, causing processing errors.\n\n**Fix:** Keep a CHANGELOG.md (Keep a Changelog format) and call out breaking changes explicitly.\n\nExample:\n\n```\n## 2.0.0\n### Breaking\n- `/v1/orders` removed; use `/v2/orders`.\n```"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
